    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it doesn't change the reality. it's like... if i was gone, the weight would just lift. they could finally breathe again. they wouldn't have to worry about me or spend all their resources trying to keep me afloat. wouldn't it be more selfless to just stop being the problem?",
